All scoping happens through `ContinuousEffect`'s "Affects*" filter fields, evaluated by `EffectManager.effectAffectsCard` (`effects.go:1592-1791`):

- **Single specific permanent (target or self)**: `AffectsSpecific string` (`effects.go:236`) — a card ID. Checked first and short-circuits everything else (`effects.go:1606-1609`):
```go
if e.AffectsSpecific != "" {
    return e.AffectsSpecific == card.ID
}
```
